{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hero - Yoiko</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the hero -\u00a0Yoiko</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The last shrine maiden of Nagamizu Shrine, who purifies tainted souls under the aegis of the Fox God. Her weapon is a nodachi, a greatsword longer than she is tall. It is whispered that when she dons her fox mask, she and the Fox God become one. Entering a state of egolessness, she wields the god's terrifying power to sever all that is wicked and profane.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4065140?t=1761019581","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4065140?t=1761019581","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065140/3b68ba45df625b0dd482e61955d403544dd27fa6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761019581","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065140/3b68ba45df625b0dd482e61955d403544dd27fa6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761019581","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hero - Yoiko</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the hero -\u00a0Yoiko</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The last shrine maiden of Nagamizu Shrine, who purifies tainted souls under the aegis of the Fox God. Her weapon is a nodachi, a greatsword longer than she is tall. It is whispered that when she dons her fox mask, she and the Fox God become one. Entering a state of egolessness, she wields the god's terrifying power to sever all that is wicked and profane.</p>","de